    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Hajnal T\u00edmea gazdag \u00e9s gy\u00f6ny\u00f6r\u0171 fot\u00f3modell, aki unja m\u00e1r a felhajt\u00e1st, egyszer\u0171, nyugodt \u00e9letre v\u00e1gyik. A tizen\u00f6t\u00e9ves \u00e9retts\u00e9gi tal\u00e1lkoz\u00f3j\u00e1n tal\u00e1lkozik Danival. A f\u00e9rfi hasonl\u00f3 c\u00edp\u0151ben j\u00e1r. B\u00e1r az esk\u00fcv\u0151j\u00e9re k\u00e9sz\u00fcl, val\u00f3j\u00e1ban unja az eg\u00e9szet, t\u0171ri a menyasszonya meg a csal\u00e1dja bas\u00e1skod\u00e1s\u00e1t. Az egykori oszt\u00e1lyt\u00e1rsak n\u00e9mi besz\u00e9lget\u00e9s \u00e9s pi\u00e1l\u00e1s ut\u00e1n egym\u00e1sra tal\u00e1lnak a ruhat\u00e1rban. Az egyetlen gond, hogy mindezt levide\u00f3zza B\u00f6g\u00f6cs, a tapl\u00f3, nagysz\u00e1j\u00fa porn\u00f3producer, aki a felv\u00e9tellel megzsarolja Danit.",
        "english": "Dani is preparing for his upcoming wedding when he meets his childhood friend, Timi who is a famous model now. After a few drinks, they sleep together on their high school reunion without knowing that they are being filmed."
